{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type FunctionalHavingRow<TContext> = TContext[\"schema\"] & TContext[\"hasResult\"] extends true ? object : object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L662","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:662"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FunctionalHavingRow - Type for the row parameter in functional having callbacks"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Functional having callbacks receive a namespaced row that includes:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Table data from the schema (when available)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"$selected: The SELECT result fields (when select() has been called)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"After "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select()"},{"type":"text","value":" is called, this type includes "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"$selected"},{"type":"text","value":" which provides access\nto the SELECT result fields via "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"$selected.fieldName"},{"type":"text","value":" syntax."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Note: When used with GROUP BY, functional having receives "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ $selected: ... }"},{"type":"text","value":" with the\naggregated SELECT results. When used without GROUP BY, it receives the full namespaced row\nwhich includes both table data and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"$selected"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"({ $selected }) => $selected.sessionCount > 2"},{"type":"text","value":"\nExample (no GROUP BY): "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(row) => row.user.salary > 70000 && row.$selected.user_count > 2"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tcontext","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TContext"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/Context.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Context"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tcontext","text":"TContext","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype FunctionalHavingRow<TContext> = TContext[\"schema\"] & TContext[\"hasResult\"] extends true ? object : object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:662](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L662)\n\nFunctionalHavingRow - Type for the row parameter in functional having callbacks\n\nFunctional having callbacks receive a namespaced row that includes:\n- Table data from the schema (when available)\n- $selected: The SELECT result fields (when select() has been called)\n\nAfter `select()` is called, this type includes `$selected` which provides access\nto the SELECT result fields via `$selected.fieldName` syntax.\n\nNote: When used with GROUP BY, functional having receives `{ $selected: ... }` with the\naggregated SELECT results. When used without GROUP BY, it receives the full namespaced row\nwhich includes both table data and `$selected`.\n\nExample: `({ $selected }) => $selected.sessionCount > 2`\nExample (no GROUP BY): `(row) => row.user.salary > 70000 && row.$selected.user_count > 2`\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TContext\n\n`TContext` *extends* [`Context`](../interfaces/Context.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FunctionalHavingRow\ntitle: FunctionalHavingRow\n---\n\n```ts\ntype FunctionalHavingRow<TContext> = TContext[\"schema\"] & TContext[\"hasResult\"] extends true ? object : object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:662](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L662)\n\nFunctionalHavingRow - Type for the row parameter in functional having callbacks\n\nFunctional having callbacks receive a namespaced row that includes:\n- Table data from the schema (when available)\n- $selected: The SELECT result fields (when select() has been called)\n\nAfter `select()` is called, this type includes `$selected` which provides access\nto the SELECT result fields via `$selected.fieldName` syntax.\n\nNote: When used with GROUP BY, functional having receives `{ $selected: ... }` with the\naggregated SELECT results. When used without GROUP BY, it receives the full namespaced row\nwhich includes both table data and `$selected`.\n\nExample: `({ $selected }) => $selected.sessionCount > 2`\nExample (no GROUP BY): `(row) => row.user.salary > 70000 && row.$selected.user_count > 2`\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TContext\n\n`TContext` *extends* [`Context`](../interfaces/Context.md)\n"}
